        "text": "def Small (k : ℕ) : Prop := 8 * D.inverseNorm k ^ 2 * D.quadraticNorm k * D.debtNorm k ≤ 1, with inverseNorm k = ‖(matrix k).symm‖ and quadraticNorm k = ‖bilinearMap k‖ on C^k — the paper's 8ν_j² q_j ‖d‖_{C^j} ≤ 1; lines 191-197 of the same file convert it to 4 ν q r ≤ 1 at r = 2 ν ‖d‖."
